set BvOPickText[99]="against all Shinigamis including Ichigo, and is an"
set BvOPickText[100]="early antagonist in the series. He comes to view"
set BvOPickText[101]="Ichigo differently over time, however, eventually"
set BvOPickText[102]="becoming a valuable ally and friendly rival."
